---
title: Test - Send Chat Message Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CP as Chat Panel
    participant Store as Session Store
    participant WS as WebSocket Client
    participant API as Chat API (Server)

    Dev->>CP: Types message, clicks Send
    Note right of CP: assert input is non-empty string
    Note right of CP: assert input is cleared after send

    CP->>Store: addMessage(user message)
    Note right of Store: assert message.role == "user"
    Note right of Store: assert message.id is non-empty string
    Note right of Store: assert messages.length == prev + 1

    CP->>Dev: Render user message bubble
    Note right of CP: assert new message appears in list
    Note right of CP: assert message styled as user bubble

    CP->>WS: send(WsSendPayload)
    Note right of WS: assert payload.type == "chat"
    Note right of WS: assert payload.sessionId matches current session
    Note right of WS: assert payload.content matches input text

    WS->>API: WebSocket frame (sessionId, content)
    Note right of WS: assert connection status is "connected" before send
    API-->>WS: Ack / processing
